{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e6ba0f6f7044b066fe23d5ec","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vo4p8i"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"CI's shell-completion gate installs fish and zsh through apt at run time, so an Ubuntu mirror DNS outage fails a required check for every pull request"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Observed 2026-11-11 on PR 1705. The Gates (smokes) step 'Verify native shell completion boundaries' (.github/workflows/ci.yml) runs sudo apt-get update and then sudo apt-get install --yes fish zsh before tests/acceptance/shell-completion.mjs. Three consecutive attempts (14:49Z, 16:03Z, 16:33Z) failed with exit 100: the ubuntu-26.04 runner (image 20261101.186.1) could not resolve azure.archive.ubuntu.com, archive.ubuntu.com or security.ubuntu.com ('Temporary failure resolving'), while packages.microsoft.com resolved. The same image had installed both shells at 08:14Z. The acceptance check itself passes locally, but one mirror outage makes a required check red and blocks every merge. Each retry also waits behind the account's shared 20-job runner pool. Duplicate check: searched apt, mirror, DNS and the shell-completion CI step; the completion items (pm-7hx6, pm-6qi8, pm-mthy, pm-q4zx) cover completion content, not the gate's provisioning."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["ci","flaky-infra","github-actions","shell-completion"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":45},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The shell-completion gate obtains fish and zsh without depending on one apt mirror lookup: apt retries with Acquire::Retries and a fallback source (Homebrew bottles or a cached package), or a runner image that ships both; A provisioning failure is reported as an infrastructure error distinct from a completion-boundary failure; The acceptance script still runs against real fish and zsh binaries"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-u9d0"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A transient Ubuntu mirror outage does not fail the required shell-completion gate"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Three attempts in two hours failed apt-get with exit 100 on DNS, blocking PR 1705's merge"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-6qi8","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-7hx6","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-mthy","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-q4zx","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-11T16:44:27.983Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash